0 Obliquity Orrery - measured Earth-axis tilt and solar declination
0 Name: model.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/obliquity-orrery.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // Parallel-crank orrery: the Earth platform is carried without rotation,
0 // so its 22.5 deg axis stays inertially fixed while the Sun direction turns.
0 // One SPIKE medium motor on port A drives the A crank axle directly.
0 // Saved pose = crank angle 45 deg (program datum, motor angle 0).
0 // The frame stands on three round feet (1L beams pinned under the rails), not on the rails:
0 // with four flat rails exactly coplanar on the floor the contact was redundant and the
0 // frame crept ~5 mm/s (issue #1435).
0 !BW ID base_rail_0
1 72 40 200 60 0 0 1 0 1 0 -1 0 0 32278.dat
0 !BW ID base_rail_1
1 72 40 200 0 0 0 1 0 1 0 -1 0 0 32278.dat
